1
00:00:17,379 --> 00:00:18,320
The old don't act their age,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,339
the young have no manners,

3
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:19,980
right?

4
00:00:20,399 --> 00:00:21,300
With no mother at home,

5
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:23,019
did nobody teach you how to behave?

6
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,879
Ma Limin, screw your ancestors!

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,160
I'll kill you!

8
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:29,300
You damn...

9
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,879
You son of a bitch!

10
00:00:31,739 --> 00:00:32,520
Get over here!

11
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:33,700
Ma Limin!

12
00:00:34,299 --> 00:00:35,520
You bullied my son!

13
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:37,520
Ma Limin, you have no shame!

14
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,520
Nobody move!

15
00:00:40,359 --> 00:00:40,880
Stop it!

16
00:00:41,659 --> 00:00:42,340
Nobody move!

17
00:00:43,259 --> 00:00:43,859
Let go!

18
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,439
Let go! Let go!

19
00:00:46,679 --> 00:00:47,979
Nobody move! Stay where you are!

20
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,119
Nobody move! Stay where you are!

21
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,200
Haizhu, are you all right?

22
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,439
Why are the police officers here?

23
00:00:55,179 --> 00:00:55,759
Nobody move!

24
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:57,659
The police are here!

25
00:00:58,219 --> 00:00:58,979
I'm not blind.

26
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,500
Officers!

27
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:02,820
You saw it with your own eyes!

28
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:04,819
Liu Haizhu and his father,

29
00:01:05,459 --> 00:01:06,540
in broad daylight,

30
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:07,319
are...

31
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,159
assaulting a factory cadre!

32
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:10,379
Aren't you going to do something?!

33
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:11,980
Officers,

34
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:13,439
he started cussing at us first!

35
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:15,519
All right, that's enough.

36
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,680
Calm down, everyone.

37
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:18,959
Comrade Liu Haizhu,

38
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,579
we're here today,

39
00:01:21,099 --> 00:01:21,879
not to investigate you.

40
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:23,939
Representing the police today,

41
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,959
we are here specifically to commend you.

42
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:27,640
What commendation?

43
00:01:28,459 --> 00:01:29,120
What commendation?

44
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,079
Comrade Liu Haizhu,

45
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,760
in a recent public security case,

46
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,719
you disregarded your own safety,

47
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:39,340
actively cooperated with the police,

48
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:41,680
bravely stopped illegal and criminal acts,

49
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:44,659
and helped the injured citizens.

50
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:46,159
Your conduct was truly exemplary.

51
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,000
With approval from higher authorities,

52
00:01:48,659 --> 00:01:49,299
you are hereby commended!

53
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:50,079
Let's give him a round of applause!

54
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,939
Great! Great!

55
00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:52,620
Great! Good job!

56
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,219
Everyone in our factory,

57
00:01:57,079 --> 00:01:58,219
especially the young workers,

58
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:01,299
must learn from Comrade Liu Haizhu!

59
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,519
Great! Good!

60
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:03,879
Learn from me?

61
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,400
Learn from him!

62
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:05,280
Everyone!

63
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,620
Thanks to Comrade Liu Haizhu coming to my rescue.

64
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,439
Otherwise,

65
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:09,819
my life would have been in grave danger.

66
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:11,539
I can vouch for that.

67
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:12,939
Liu Haizhu only fought

68
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:15,800
to protect Teacher Feng and me.

69
00:02:15,979 --> 00:02:17,080
He's a real hero!

70
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,300
That's absolutely right.

71
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:20,479
Thanks to the lead Comrade Liu Haizhu gave us,

72
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:21,819
that criminal gang on the west outskirts,

73
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:23,759
we busted them in one fell swoop!

74
00:02:23,979 --> 00:02:25,620
We recovered dozens of stolen bicycles!

75
00:02:26,219 --> 00:02:28,180
The officers should take a photo! They must!

76
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:28,879
All right, all right.

77
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:29,599
That's enough.

78
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:33,740
Liu Haizhu, let me tell you,

79
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,039
deeds don't cancel out misdeeds.

80
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:37,560
The fact remains,

81
00:02:37,699 --> 00:02:39,539
you still run around with street thugs,

82
00:02:39,939 --> 00:02:41,860
pulling off all sorts of shady business,

83
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,039
neglecting your job and skipping real work.

84
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:45,280
Just for that alone,

85
00:02:46,379 --> 00:02:47,419
I'm not revoking your disciplinary penalty.

86
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,340
Wait, the officers said I did nothing wrong!

87
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:51,240
Deputy Director Ma,

88
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,099
regarding Comrade Liu Haizhu,

89
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:55,759
I wrote a letter to the director.

90
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,520
Here's the director's handwritten reply.

91
00:02:58,759 --> 00:02:59,340
Take a look.

92
00:03:07,539 --> 00:03:08,060
Read it!

93
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,759
"Dear Zhou Meng,

94
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,120
Comrade Liu Haizhu,

95
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:12,979
while ensuring the completion

96
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,539
of all production tasks,

97
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:15,479
has dared to explore,

98
00:03:15,819 --> 00:03:17,819
answering the state's call to revitalize the economy

99
00:03:18,259 --> 00:03:19,659
by engaging in private business.

100
00:03:19,819 --> 00:03:21,259
It is recommended that Comrade Liu Haizhu

101
00:03:21,879 --> 00:03:23,280
receive a factory-wide commendation

102
00:03:24,259 --> 00:03:26,979
and the title of Advanced Individual in Reform Practice."

103
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,439
Look at that. What a title!

104
00:03:28,539 --> 00:03:29,080
Great!

105
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:30,639
Great, great, great!

106
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,580
Look, it's even signed by the factory director.

107
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:33,360
I'm not blind.

108
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,020
I didn't expect this either.

109
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:36,740
Alright, that's enough.

110
00:03:38,659 --> 00:03:41,039
Since it's the director's decision,

111
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:43,860
then Liu Haizhu's punishment is...

112
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:48,800
revoked.

113
00:03:49,659 --> 00:03:51,039
Good, good, good.

114
00:03:51,539 --> 00:03:52,099
Then at the factory-wide meeting,

115
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,939
should I read the commendation letter?

116
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:55,379
Come on.

117
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,180
Quit while you're ahead.

118
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:56,860
Right, right, of course.

119
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,319
Um, Officer,

120
00:03:58,419 --> 00:03:58,919
thank you.

121
00:03:58,939 --> 00:03:59,599
Thank you so much.

122
00:04:00,099 --> 00:04:00,560
Well...

123
00:04:00,659 --> 00:04:01,639
That won't be proper.

124
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,139
Alright.

125
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:02,780
Thanks.

126
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,139
Everyone, get back to what you were doing.

127
00:04:04,259 --> 00:04:04,780
Wrap it up.

128
00:04:06,379 --> 00:04:06,919
Alright.

129
00:04:06,979 --> 00:04:07,599
Let me see, let me see.

130
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:08,639
Naturally.

131
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:10,099
It's all in the bag!

132
00:04:10,139 --> 00:04:11,340
Come over to my place for dumplings later!

133
00:04:11,419 --> 00:04:12,659
Sure thing!

134
00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:13,319
Director Ma.

135
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,420
We've been bickering for so long. Aren't you thirsty?

136
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:19,500
I'm doing fine.

137
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:20,920
Well, I'm thirsty.

138
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,480
How about inviting me to your office for tea?

139
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,879
Sure, sounds good.

140
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:30,980
Please, after you.

141
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,379
Officer, after you. Let's go.

142
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:45,939
Officer Kong.

143
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:47,920
Thank you.

144
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:51,620
Officer Kong,

145
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,779
the banner's been presented,

146
00:04:54,819 --> 00:04:55,759
and the commendation's been given.

147
00:04:56,379 --> 00:04:57,339
Any other instructions?

148
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,439
Nothing. Just having a chat.

149
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,279
Director Ma,

150
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:03,980
a while back,

151
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,459
that case at the tractor factory...

152
00:05:05,819 --> 00:05:06,579
You've heard about it, right?

153
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:11,000
I have.

154
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,360
Isn't it still unsolved?

155
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,259
Who told you it wasn't solved?

156
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:20,100
No one told me.

157
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:23,160
One thing just led to another in our talk.

158
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:26,800
Besides,

159
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:29,339
you're bringing up the tractor factory,

160
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:30,740
yet you come to ask me at my shipyard.

161
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:31,800
One is in the water,

162
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,740
and the other is on land.

163
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,500
You can't lump them together.

164
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,879
These two factories aren't the same at all.

165
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:40,540
Here's what I mean, Director Ma.

166
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:43,540
You have plenty of supplies here at the shipyard.

167
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:44,800
And right now,

168
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,699
things aren't so peaceful out there.

169
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,459
Director Ma,

170
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,459
you need to stay on your guard.

171
00:05:56,459 --> 00:05:57,620
Well, you're really worrying for nothing.

172
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:00,160
Our security here is very tight.

173
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:02,160
If you're still uneasy,

174
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,579
I'll tighten it even more.

175
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:05,680
All right.

176
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:09,779
So,

177
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:11,899
any other instructions?

178
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,379
No instructions.

179
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:15,959
Just a friendly heads-up.

180
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:18,079
New Year's is right around the corner,

181
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,480
so I just want to make sure

182
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,019
everyone has a good holiday.

183
00:06:23,879 --> 00:06:24,360
That's right.

184
00:06:25,339 --> 00:06:25,980
Have a good New Year.

185
00:06:26,779 --> 00:06:27,160
All right.

186
00:06:28,519 --> 00:06:29,379
I'll head back now.

187
00:06:31,060 --> 00:06:32,180
You didn't even have a sip of water.

188
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:34,879
Tell you what,

189
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,180
next time there's a chance,

190
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,360
treat me to tea.

191
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:41,339
That goes without saying!

192
00:06:41,699 --> 00:06:42,339
Whenever you drop by,

193
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:43,740
I'll treat you to drinks.

194
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,639
As long as you have the time,

195
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,279
we'll have a proper drink together.

196
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,360
Regulations forbid it.

197
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:49,600
Tea it is, then.

198
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:50,420
Sounds good.

199
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,139
Drop by anytime!

200
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,860
What are you doing?

201
00:07:04,839 --> 00:07:05,779
I'm keeping an eye on him.

202
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,319
I'm not letting him out of my sight.

203
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:10,060
"Good Citizen of Songliao, Soul of Chivalry."

204
00:07:10,139 --> 00:07:11,019
Look at how well that's written.

205
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:12,259
Being educated really makes a difference.

206
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,100
Bro.

207
00:07:13,939 --> 00:07:14,819
Let me take a look.

208
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:15,920
I'll hang it back up after I'm done.

209
00:07:16,180 --> 00:07:16,740
Here, take it.

210
00:07:16,779 --> 00:07:17,420
All right, thanks.

211
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,759
Don't ruin it!

212
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:19,920
Mind your own business.

213
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,779
Be careful.

214
00:07:21,139 --> 00:07:21,699
Careful now!

215
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,620
Don't worry.

216
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,240
Thank you, Teacher Feng.

217
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,759
It was the least I could do.

218
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,180
Really, thank you so much.

219
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:28,860
I mean it.

220
00:07:29,019 --> 00:07:30,360
Making you come all this way...

221
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:30,959
Look...

222
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,360
You saved my life, after all.

223
00:07:32,899 --> 00:07:34,319
You've thanked everyone else.

224
00:07:34,339 --> 00:07:35,899
Why aren't you thanking me?

225
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,060
I'm the one who brought the banner over.

226
00:07:38,740 --> 00:07:39,420
I thank you.

227
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,600
I'm most grateful to you.

228
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,060
How are you going to thank me?

229
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:43,439
Shouldn't you show some appreciation?

230
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,439
Well... you tell me then.

231
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,480
How should I show it?

232
00:07:47,139 --> 00:07:48,259
Treat me to a movie.

233
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:49,379
A movie?

234
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:50,259
Sure.

235
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:51,139
This weekend, then?

236
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,160
Awesome!

237
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:53,139
What movie?

238
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,899
What's playing right now?

239
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:55,959
Comrade Zhou Meng,

240
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,339
I'll pass on the movie.

241
00:07:57,779 --> 00:07:58,720
I have a poetry reading to attend.

242
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:00,079
You're welcome to join anytime.

243
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,220
Uh, how did you get here?

244
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:04,060
Let me walk you out.

245
00:08:05,339 --> 00:08:06,759
No need, I can head back myself.

246
00:08:07,379 --> 00:08:07,759
All right.

247
00:08:07,819 --> 00:08:09,180
Then... I won't see you out. Take care.

248
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,579
Thanks. Thank you.

249
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:11,759
Take care. Goodbye.

250
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:12,800
Goodbye.

251
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,779
So what movie is playing right now?

252
00:08:16,639 --> 00:08:17,120
It's...

253
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,519
The Shaolin Temple.

254
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:21,579
It's The Shaolin Temple.

255
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,399
You're treating me.

256
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:23,620
All right, my treat.

257
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:08,679
Come on, come on.

258
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:10,940
Sanbiangua!

259
00:09:11,019 --> 00:09:11,899
So this is disco.

260
00:09:13,679 --> 00:09:15,460
Can you even see with sunglasses indoors?

261
00:09:16,399 --> 00:09:17,019
It's fine, not bad.

262
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:17,980
Brother Zhuzi, you're here!

263
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:18,620
Yeah, I'm here.

264
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:19,120
Perfect timing.

265
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,419
Find my friends a place to sit.

266
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:21,580
Order whatever you want to eat and drink.

267
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:22,679
Just treat it like the factory cafeteria.

268
00:09:22,799 --> 00:09:23,360
It's all on me.

269
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,259
Come on, this way.

270
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:24,820
Right this way, please.

271
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:25,620
Right this way, right this way.

272
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:26,679
Have a seat.

273
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,419
Zhuzi, you're here.

274
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:28,179
Sit wherever you like.

275
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:28,759
Tell you what.

276
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,240
I'll grab everyone some food and drinks.

277
00:09:30,539 --> 00:09:30,820
Hold on a second.

278
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:31,879
Let me show you something.

279
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,980
A grand silk banner! What do you think?

280
00:09:36,259 --> 00:09:38,620
"Liu Haizhu, the Soul of Chivalry."

281
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:40,059
Pretty nice, right?

282
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:40,940
Looks sharp!

283
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:42,700
Great, let's hang it right here.

284
00:09:45,659 --> 00:09:46,580
You mean...

285
00:09:48,259 --> 00:09:49,419
This...

286
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,440
Pure righteous spirit!

287
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:52,500
Great, great, great.

288
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:53,779
I'm truly impressed.

289
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,200
Wait.

290
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:56,320
Zhuzi, in a place like ours,

291
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:57,940
is it really appropriate to hang this here?

292
00:09:58,879 --> 00:09:59,840
Why wouldn't it be?

293
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:01,220
It's great! Really boosts morale.

294
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:03,159
Anyone who walks in will see it, right?

295
00:10:03,259 --> 00:10:04,220
Everyone needs a moral compass.

296
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:05,740
Gotta be a good citizen of Songliao!

297
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,360
No, look, I mean...

298
00:10:07,419 --> 00:10:08,320
Fine, fine, hang it right here then.

299
00:10:08,379 --> 00:10:09,379
What if someone...

300
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:10,440
See?

301
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:12,080
Told you these garlands would look great here.

302
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,159
Turned out real nice.

303
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:14,500
Not bad. Go get back to work.

304
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:15,240
Wait, but...

305
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,220
These garlands...

306
00:10:22,019 --> 00:10:22,720
And this banner...

307
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:42,200
Bro.

308
00:10:44,379 --> 00:10:44,840
Menglong.

309
00:10:46,139 --> 00:10:47,019
Teach me how to box.

310
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:49,299
Wanna learn?

311
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:50,639
Come on, give it a shot.

312
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,120
Stop, stop, stop.

313
00:11:05,899 --> 00:11:07,759
Boxing isn't just about brute force.

314
00:11:07,899 --> 00:11:08,559
Learn the stance first.

315
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,340
Throw a punch.

316
00:11:10,639 --> 00:11:11,779
Punch out in a straight line.

317
00:11:12,539 --> 00:11:13,580
Pull it back along that same line.

318
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,820
Drive the punch with your waist.

319
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,100
Give it a try.

320
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:24,759
Not bad.

321
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,700
Much better.

322
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,320
Stop.

323
00:11:38,179 --> 00:11:39,399
What's the matter, Menglong?

324
00:11:41,139 --> 00:11:42,039
I used to think

325
00:11:43,379 --> 00:11:44,460
cramming my head with knowledge mattered,

326
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:45,860
but now I see it's useless.

327
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,000
When real danger strikes,

328
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,460
I can't even protect those around me.

329
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:51,559
It's completely useless.

330
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:58,399
Come here.

331
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:07,299
Studying hard can protect people too.

332
00:12:08,899 --> 00:12:09,879
I used to think

333
00:12:10,059 --> 00:12:10,980
if I studied hard

334
00:12:11,340 --> 00:12:12,200
and understood how the world works,

335
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,639
I could steer clear of trouble.

336
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:16,620
But when real danger comes,

337
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,320
the person I want to protect the most...

338
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:19,179
I can't even protect them.

339
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:21,720
What good is all this knowledge?

340
00:12:22,019 --> 00:12:22,840
What's the point?

341
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,100
It's just armchair talk,

342
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:27,519
a coward's excuse.

343
00:12:31,799 --> 00:12:32,980
I told you to study hard

344
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,399
so you wouldn't walk the path I took.

345
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:38,659
Brother...

346
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:39,759
You read books too.

347
00:12:40,059 --> 00:12:41,100
You know just as much as I do.

348
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:46,120
I train, I take beatings,

349
00:12:46,259 --> 00:12:46,879
and I bleed...

350
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,620
so you won't have to train,

351
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:50,059
won't have to get beaten or bleed.

352
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,799
Take my advice.

353
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:52,960
Study hard.

354
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:54,460
That's your path.

355
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:56,659
But Brother...

356
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:57,840
I can't just...

357
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,679
hide behind you forever.

358
00:12:58,779 --> 00:12:59,259
Brother Tian.

359
00:13:14,559 --> 00:13:14,980
Menglong.

360
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,559
That's it for now. Go on up.

361
00:13:17,059 --> 00:13:17,759
We'll practice later.

362
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:20,279
Come here.

363
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,539
Haven't seen you in a while,

364
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:40,559
Feng Ziwen.

365
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,779
What an honor to have you here, Officer.

366
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:43,480
Did I

367
00:13:44,139 --> 00:13:44,899
mess up again,

368
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:45,820
or did you just

369
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:47,759
happen to drop by?

370
00:13:49,299 --> 00:13:50,100
There's a case

371
00:13:50,659 --> 00:13:51,580
we need your help with.

372
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,799
A large batch of materials was stolen from the tractor factory.

373
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,139
On Songliao's black market,

374
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:57,600
and through your channels,

375
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:58,919
have you heard any

376
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,279
whispers lately?

377
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:05,220
I don't follow you.

378
00:14:05,700 --> 00:14:06,399
Are you

379
00:14:09,519 --> 00:14:10,279
suspecting me?

380
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:13,879
The government allows private enterprise now.

381
00:14:14,659 --> 00:14:16,399
I run my coal business fair and square.

382
00:14:16,799 --> 00:14:17,840
How would I know anything about that?

383
00:14:19,700 --> 00:14:20,799
Songliao is only so big.

384
00:14:21,539 --> 00:14:23,799
Any stirrings on the street

385
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,159
should've reached your ears.

386
00:14:25,779 --> 00:14:26,279
First off,

387
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:27,820
my business is clean.

388
00:14:28,019 --> 00:14:29,980
I don't deal in petty theft,

389
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:31,360
so I wouldn't hear about that.

390
00:14:31,980 --> 00:14:32,600
Second of all,

391
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:33,860
Officer,

392
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,179
we're not close.

393
00:14:35,519 --> 00:14:36,799
Why would I tell you anything?

394
00:14:37,259 --> 00:14:38,259
I'm under no obligation.

395
00:14:41,019 --> 00:14:41,600
Feng Ziwen,

396
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:43,360
I know

397
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:46,139
you hold a grudge against the police.

398
00:14:47,259 --> 00:14:49,200
What happened with Chen Baige back then...

399
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:50,139
Brother Ziwen.

400
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:52,080
No need to bring up the past.

401
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,320
Let me make this clear:

402
00:14:55,559 --> 00:14:56,440
I, Feng Ziwen,

403
00:14:56,899 --> 00:14:57,779
have never done anything

404
00:14:57,980 --> 00:14:59,240
to cause trouble for anyone.

405
00:15:00,100 --> 00:15:01,879
Not before, and certainly not now.

406
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:03,559
My siblings and I hold our lives

407
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,679
in our own hands.

408
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,600
We don't need anyone meddling.

409
00:15:06,899 --> 00:15:07,659
Officer Kong,

410
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,879
did you need something today?

411
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:15,580
Nothing.

412
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:16,860
Took a wrong turn.

413
00:15:17,639 --> 00:15:18,120
Be on your way, then.

414
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:21,960
Fine.

415
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:23,700
I'll take my leave.

416
00:15:29,279 --> 00:15:29,940
Brother Ziwen,

417
00:15:30,779 --> 00:15:32,360
why would they come after us for this?

418
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,039
What's there to be afraid of?

419
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,500
We've got nothing to hide.

420
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,039
I'm just worried about you.

421
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:42,399
Don't worry.

422
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,039
The worst is behind us.

423
00:15:53,679 --> 00:15:54,379
He really can't see.

424
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,419
Bro's dancing pretty well.

425
00:15:59,799 --> 00:16:01,080
Look at Sanbiangua.

426
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,360
The two of them are actually having fun.

427
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:04,840
Think the two of them will work out?

428
00:16:04,899 --> 00:16:05,460
Not a chance.

429
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,039
Why's that?

430
00:16:06,259 --> 00:16:07,200
Sanbiangua is too dumb.

431
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:12,840
What's that guy doing?

432
00:16:14,519 --> 00:16:16,000
How about a dance, sweetheart?

433
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:16,720
Get lost.

434
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:17,860
This girl...

435
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:20,360
Wait here, let me go check it out.

436
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:27,860
What are you doing?

437
00:16:28,559 --> 00:16:29,240
None of your damn business.

438
00:16:29,419 --> 00:16:29,799
Get the hell out.

439
00:16:31,279 --> 00:16:32,720
Watch your mouth.

440
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:33,460
What's your problem?

441
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:34,879
What do you mean?

442
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,000
What's wrong, Zhuzi?

443
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:37,379
Harassing people.

444
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:38,559
Zhuzi.

445
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:40,779
You're Liu Haizhu?

446
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:41,899
Yeah, so what?

447
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:44,279
Got business with me?

448
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:45,919
This is Liu Haizhu.

449
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,320
Sorry, Brother Zhuzi.

450
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:48,980
He's had a bit too much to drink.

451
00:16:49,659 --> 00:16:50,200
Hurry, let's go.

452
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:50,940
Hold on.

453
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:51,659
Get back here. Get back here!

454
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:52,659
Stand right there.

455
00:16:54,539 --> 00:16:55,700
If you're gonna hang out, behave.

456
00:16:56,419 --> 00:16:57,259
But if you wanna pull dirty crap,

457
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:58,379
get the hell out of here.

458
00:16:58,519 --> 00:16:59,019
You hear me?

459
00:17:00,639 --> 00:17:01,059
Get back here.

460
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:02,519
Did I say you two could leave?

461
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,660
Go settle the bill.

462
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:06,279
Head inside.

463
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:13,240
Have fun.

464
00:17:13,339 --> 00:17:13,859
Thank you.

465
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,539
Look at you, Zhuzi.

466
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,359
Running the turf now, quite the big shot.

467
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,599
What big shot?

468
00:17:21,019 --> 00:17:22,359
You just chased all my customers away.

469
00:17:22,519 --> 00:17:24,640
In this dance hall business,

470
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,799
men and women are supposed to mingle and date.

471
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:27,339
Come on, what "mingling"?

472
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,559
He still shouldn't be harassing people.

473
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:29,859
That's just being a hooligan!

474
00:17:30,859 --> 00:17:32,180
Then why don't you come police it every day?

475
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,700
Go stand out front as a guardian god.

476
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:36,759
I'll slap you right on the door.

477
00:17:43,539 --> 00:17:44,920
Not bad, Brother Zhuzi.

478
00:17:45,339 --> 00:17:46,180
Got real skills!

479
00:17:46,220 --> 00:17:46,660
Awesome!

480
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,039
Real badass, Brother Zhuzi.

481
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:49,380
You're a pretty good dancer.

482
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:49,980
Damn right!

483
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:51,019
Come on, drink up! Drink!

484
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:51,660
Cheers!

485
00:17:56,759 --> 00:17:57,180
Brother.

486
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,500
Thanks for earlier.

487
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,220
No, it's nothing at all.

488
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:03,420
Well...

489
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:04,720
I just hate bullies.

490
00:18:05,019 --> 00:18:06,640
If anyone messes with you again, come find me.

491
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:07,480
All right, will do.

492
00:18:07,779 --> 00:18:08,759
He'll sort it out.

493
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:11,000
Big Bro of Songliao, shipyard bike mechanic.

494
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:13,000
Not done chatting yet? You two drink together.

495
00:18:16,859 --> 00:18:17,700
I'm heading out.

496
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,259
Yeah, come back anytime!

497
00:18:22,619 --> 00:18:24,039
Not bad, Brother Zhuzi!

498
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:26,500
Quite the charmer, got plenty of friends.

499
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:28,819
What're you saying? What "Brother Zhuzi"?

500
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,759
They're just egging me on with that nickname.

501
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,180
Stop laughing! What're you all laughing at?

502
00:18:36,619 --> 00:18:37,720
You're my big brother.

503
00:18:38,279 --> 00:18:39,700
Besides, you know how to drive, don't you?

504
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,079
I wouldn't dare be your big brother.

505
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,480
Put it on, Big Brother.

506
00:18:43,599 --> 00:18:44,019
Big Brother.

507
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:45,059
Come on, drink up, drink!

508
00:18:45,059 --> 00:18:45,839
Drink up! Come on!

509
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,200
Cheers, cheers!

510
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:54,900
You can really drink, Big Bro of Songliao.

511
00:18:58,859 --> 00:18:59,819
I can't drink this stuff.

512
00:19:03,859 --> 00:19:04,279
Hold on.

513
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,400
Wait a second.

514
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:11,400
I said hold on, didn't I?

515
00:19:15,619 --> 00:19:16,940
Don't be nervous.

516
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:20,299
Your place is a real dump.

517
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,759
Is it over that deputy director thing?

518
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:25,700
You're out?

519
00:19:28,019 --> 00:19:28,640
What shitty tea.

520
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,799
Don't you have anything better to brew?

521
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:31,640
Zhang Haoran.

522
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:33,619
This is the factory office.

523
00:19:34,059 --> 00:19:35,119
You think you can just waltz in here?

524
00:19:36,759 --> 00:19:37,920
Now that you're out, keep your head down.

525
00:19:38,019 --> 00:19:38,740
What the hell are you doing in my office?

526
00:19:38,819 --> 00:19:39,559
If someone sees you...

527
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:41,660
Put your damn legs down!

528
00:19:43,579 --> 00:19:44,539
Pacing back and forth like this...

529
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:45,660
What if someone sees you?

530
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,779
So what if they see? Did I break the law?

531
00:19:48,779 --> 00:19:50,099
The cops tried to pin a charge on me

532
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,240
for running a prostitution ring.

533
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,779
But they had zero evidence.

534
00:19:53,420 --> 00:19:54,599
So didn't they just politely show me the door?

535
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:56,279
What? Is your factory

536
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:57,380
not welcoming to upstanding citizens like me,

537
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,180
or is it you, Ma Limin, who isn't welcoming?

538
00:20:04,759 --> 00:20:06,660
I'm not talking about prostitution.

539
00:20:09,059 --> 00:20:09,559
Boss Zhang.

540
00:20:10,660 --> 00:20:12,220
I'll be straight with you.

541
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,500
That deal we discussed earlier,

542
00:20:15,019 --> 00:20:16,019
I think the risk is way too high.

543
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,119
If anything goes wrong, I can't take the fall.

544
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:21,500
Take what fall? Who asked you to take it?

545
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,319
I know what this is about.

546
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:24,380
Did the cops come by a couple of days ago

547
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,859
to question you about the tractor factory?

548
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:27,299
So what if they did?

549
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:28,740
Am I not sitting right here completely fine?

550
00:20:28,859 --> 00:20:29,680
What're you worried about?

551
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,420
You know the police came?

552
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:41,579
You're pretty tall.

553
00:20:48,839 --> 00:20:49,799
Here in Songliao,

554
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:51,079
if I, Zhang Haoran, want to find out about something,

555
00:20:51,259 --> 00:20:52,380
it's not that hard, is it?

556
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,140
When I was locked up a couple of days ago,

557
00:20:56,539 --> 00:20:57,579
I heard things were pretty lively on your end.

558
00:20:58,299 --> 00:20:59,440
With a female sent-down youth from your factory,

559
00:20:59,519 --> 00:21:00,539
getting all tangled up.

560
00:21:02,319 --> 00:21:04,099
Yet you haven't done jack about our real business.

561
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:04,619
Right?

562
00:21:05,299 --> 00:21:06,500
Those are two separate things.

563
00:21:06,660 --> 00:21:07,819
How are they two separate things?

564
00:21:08,579 --> 00:21:09,980
To me, they're the exact same thing.

565
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:11,920
They're your business.

566
00:21:16,859 --> 00:21:17,960
Though neither is a big deal.

567
00:21:19,019 --> 00:21:20,200
Because we're friends, after all.

568
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:21,660
Friends?

569
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,339
We are friends.

570
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:25,819
Come on.

571
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:33,380
Because the two of us are friends.

572
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:34,740
Come on, sit.

573
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,940
As for the business between us,

574
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,500
as long as you give the nod,

575
00:21:41,519 --> 00:21:42,940
how the goods get moved out,

576
00:21:43,279 --> 00:21:44,339
how to clean up the mess...

577
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:46,420
you won't have to lift a single finger.

578
00:21:46,819 --> 00:21:47,619
I'll handle everything.

579
00:21:49,059 --> 00:21:50,140
And all the things you like...

580
00:21:50,579 --> 00:21:51,259
money,

581
00:21:51,619 --> 00:21:52,500
a future,

582
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,859
women with killer curves...

583
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,019
I'll set you up with all of it.

584
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:03,539
But all this

585
00:22:04,140 --> 00:22:05,099
comes with a condition.

586
00:22:06,339 --> 00:22:08,339
The condition is you can't keep dragging your feet,

587
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:09,759
scared of every little thing,

588
00:22:09,819 --> 00:22:10,880
doing nothing at all.

589
00:22:12,099 --> 00:22:13,299
That's not what friends do.

590
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:18,099
That turns us into enemies.

591
00:22:22,599 --> 00:22:23,339
All right.

592
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:25,519
Boss Zhang.

593
00:22:26,819 --> 00:22:27,900
Since this is a partnership,

594
00:22:30,079 --> 00:22:31,099
do a favor for me, too.

595
00:22:35,599 --> 00:22:36,259
What is it?

596
00:22:36,740 --> 00:22:37,460
Wanna kill someone?
